      "widgets_values": [
        "1. Sign in to Dreamina in **ComfyUI menu → Extensions → Dreamina → Dreamina Settings**.\n2. In **Photo**, upload a photo of one product, such as a bottle or a shoe.\n3. In **Change**, say where to put it. `{{image1}}` stands for your photo.\n4. Press **Run**. The edited photo is saved under `image/dreamina`."
      ],
      "title": "Start Here"
    },
